## 2. Scope — what this covers

This notice applies to everything in this repository and everything produced
from it, including without limitation:

- **Source code** — all GML, scripts, shaders, functions, data files and
  configuration.
- **Art assets** — sprites, sprite sheets, templates and coordinate guides,
  tilesets, character and enemy art, backgrounds, UI panels, cursors, icons and
  logos.
- **Audio assets** — music, sound effects and voice.
- **Typography** — fonts and font derivatives created for the game.
- **Written content** — story, script, dialogue, lore, character names and
  biographies, item and enemy descriptions, and the Bestiary.
- **Design and documentation** — the game design document, art direction, zone
  and content design, roadmaps, test plans, prompts, changelog and all other
  written materials.
- **Names and marks** — "ASHEN CROWN", "Eastern Goat Forge", "Kael Varyn" and
  any related titles, logos and trade dress.
- **Builds and derivatives** — compiled builds, ports, localizations, sequels,
  prequels, remakes and any other derivative work.

